  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>It is Hoffmann bromamide degradation reaction in which propanamide&nbsp;is converted to an ethylamine&nbsp;containing one carbon atom lesser than in the amide.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0077_a66c1e6f1565.png\" style=\"width: 550px; height: 166px;\" /></p>"
